Ochre jellies are yellow, boneless oozes that lash out with limbs of themselves and hold what they catch. A blade cuts into one and it comes apart into two, and what is killed melts down to a puddle of water. The one at the sewage works in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|royal waterways]] threw a wash of acid over the room and laid a curse on [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] that aged him for a moment and left him with a gray hair.
